{"id":"prepositions-0127","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 127","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Advertising has a huge influence ___ children.","hint":"influence ___ sb","explanation":"have an influence ON somebody/something."},{"answer":"about","accept":["of"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Residents complained ___ the noise every night.","hint":"complain ___ sth","explanation":"complain ABOUT something (or complain TO somebody ABOUT it)."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The surgeon operated ___ the patient for four hours.","hint":"operate ___ sb","explanation":"operate ON a patient (for a condition)."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I\u0027m looking ___ my keys \u2014 have you seen them?","hint":"look ___ = search","explanation":"look FOR = try to find."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":["by","for","of","about"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"They apologised ___ the delay in replying.","hint":"apologise ___ something","explanation":"\u0027Apologise for something\u0027 \u2014 the thing excused takes \u0027for\u0027."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I strongly disapprove ___ smoking indoors.","hint":"disapprove ___ sth","explanation":"disapprove OF something (opposite: approve of)."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The puppies were scared ___ fireworks.","hint":"scared ___ sth","explanation":"scared OF something."},{"answer":"with","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"We\u0027re not entirely satisfied ___ the service.","hint":"satisfied ___ sth","explanation":"satisfied WITH something."}]}